The container images include FFmpeg 9.0.2, licensed under the LGPL 2.1 or
later, and Debian's LAME library, licensed under the LGPL 2.0 or later. Each
image includes their source code, build configuration, licences and
redistribution instructions in /usr/local/share/bananawiki/media. The FFmpeg
build recipe and its release verification files are in docker/media in this
repository.

The container images also update the ACL library (LGPL 2.1 or later) and
install a compatible GNU tar (GPL 3 or later) from authenticated Debian
packages. Their source code, licences and publisher verification records,
together with the matching GNU coreutils source code, are included in
/usr/local/share/bananawiki/acl.

